1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:07,558
Under a sky finally thinning of smoke,
hundreds of thousands filled the square.

2
00:00:07,598 --> 00:00:13,927
Women without hijabs, old men with
faded flags, parents carrying children.

3
00:00:13,967 --> 00:00:18,660
A Nowruz song rose three days
before spring's new year.

4
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:23,605
The IRGC held back — one Basij
member set down his baton.
